# --- Co-located non-Device-Info project (SystemUI reverse engineering) ---
# This folder physically contains an unrelated Android/SystemUI project.
# These rules keep `git add .` from polluting the Device Info repository.
# They intentionally do NOT match any Device Info path (main.py, app/,
# cli/, docs/, requirements.txt, README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md,
# AUDIT_REPORT.md, tools/.gitkeep).
SystemUI-src/
SystemUI-samsung-src/
sysui_rro_product_src/
build/
*.apk
tools/apktool*.jar
tools/apktool*.json
tools/apktool*.log
tools/*.ps1
tools/decode-incomplete/
tools/framework/
tools/samsung-framework/
tools/samsung-stage1-audit/
tools/qs-stage1-audit/
tools/SystemUI-original.sha256
